GATOS DA CORTE — BACKEND MAP
Versioned API prefix: /api/v1
Application entrypoint: app.main:app

REQUEST FLOW
=============
HTTP request
  -> app/main.py
  -> app/api/router.py
  -> app/api/<domain>.py              route, dependency, query/body validation
  -> app/controllers/<domain>_controller.py
  -> app/services/<domain>_service.py business rules and SQLAlchemy queries
  -> app/models/entities.py           PostgreSQL mapping
  -> app/db/database.py               engine and request-scoped Session

Response path:
  model/service -> controller -> Pydantic response schema -> HTTP response

MODULES
=======
app/main.py                            FastAPI application
app/api/router.py                      API router composition
app/api/system.py                      /health
app/api/cats.py                        public cats and admin cat CRUD
app/api/cat_admin_resources.py         admin cat photos and private health records
app/api/partners.py                    public partners and admin partner CRUD
app/api/campaigns.py                   public campaigns and admin campaign CRUD
app/api/guide.py                       public Guide and admin category/article CRUD
app/api/adoptions.py                   adoption intake, admin status and history
app/api/medications.py                 medication intake and admin status

app/controllers/                       HTTP orchestration and error translation
app/services/                           business rules and data access
app/schemas/                            Pydantic input/output DTOs
app/models/entities.py                 SQLAlchemy entities, relations and indexes
app/models/enums.py                    domain status/category enums
app/db/base.py                          declarative ORM Base
app/db/database.py                      engine and Session dependency
app/db/seed.py                          repeatable demo cats and partners
app/core/config.py                      APP_NAME, APP_ENV, DATABASE_URL

