ROUTE GROUPS
============
Public reads:
  /cats
  /partners
  /campaigns
  /guide/categories
  /guide/articles

Development-only administration:
  /admin/cats
  /admin/cats/{catId}/photos
  /admin/cats/{catId}/health-records
  /admin/partners
  /admin/campaigns
  /admin/guide/categories
  /admin/guide/articles
  /admin/adoption-applications
  /admin/medication-requests

Development-only intake:
  /adoption-applications
  /medication-requests

SCHEMA HISTORY
==============
0001_initial_schema               baseline tables
0002_partners                     partners and social links
0003_cat_delete_cascade           cat deletion cascades to adoption requests
0004_adoption_history_medications adoption status history and medication requests

Operational note: a migration file in the repository is not proof that the
database has applied it. Check Alembic's current revision before using routes
whose tables or PostgreSQL enums were added by a later revision. Admin and
intake routes above are unauthenticated and must remain in APP_ENV=development.
